# Surge rule list
DOMAIN,exact.example.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,suffix.example.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,proxied.example.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,nopolicy.example.com
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,adtrack,REJECT-TINYGIF
URL-REGEX,^https?://x\.example\.com/ads/,REJECT
IP-CIDR,192.0.2.0/24,REJECT,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2001:db8::/32,REJECT
GEOIP,CN,DIRECT
FINAL,DIRECT
host, qx.example.com, reject
host-suffix, qxs.example.com, reject
host-keyword, qxk, reject
[URL Rewrite]
^https://x.example.com - reject
